DHARMA PUBLIC LICENSE v1.0
===========================

This work is offered freely for the benefit of all living beings (सर्वे भवन्तु सुखिनः).

Permissions:
- Use freely for agriculture, education, environmental protection
- Share freely with farmers, villages, schools, ashrams
- Modify freely to serve local needs and languages
- Distribute freely via any medium (SD card, Bluetooth, radio, print)

Restrictions:
- Do not charge for this software itself
- Do not remove this license or the credits to the Vedic sources
- Do not use for chemical pesticide promotion or industrial agriculture
  that harms soil, water, or living beings

The knowledge within comes from the Rishis, the Upanishads, the Puranas,
and the living tradition of Indian agriculture. It belongs to no one.
It is offered back to the soil from which it came.

— Divine Earthly, Silchar, Assam
  सत्यमेव जयते (Truth Alone Triumphs)
